cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use FACET, please cite it using the metadata in this file."
type: software
title: "FACET: backbone torsion angle prediction from NMR chemical shifts"
abstract: >-
  FACET predicts protein backbone phi/psi torsion angles, secondary structure,
  chi1 rotamers and per-residue Ramachandran basin populations from backbone
  NMR chemical shifts, using a local-biased transformer with retrieval over a
  250K-residue reference index. Outputs include XPLOR/CNS, CYANA and NEF
  dihedral restraints.
authors:
  - family-names: Zinke
    given-names: Maximilian
    email: maximilian.zinke@gmail.com
version: 0.4.0
date-released: "2026-08-30"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/maxzinke/facet-nmr"
url: "https://huggingface.co/spaces/SiXa18/facet"
keywords:
  - NMR
  - chemical shifts
  - torsion angles
  - dihedral restraints
  - protein structure
  - secondary structure
